import{_ as n,o as i,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 799 | Transcended Ones and Growth | The Transcended One's Self-Transcendence and Civilizational Transcendence","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 799 | Transcended Ones and Growth | The Transcended One's Self-Transcendence and Civilizational Transcendence","no":799,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Growth","Self-Transcendence","Civilizational Transcendence","Perpetual Construction"],"related":["07-Self-Generated-Self-Grown Evolution Law","797-Transcended Ones and Growth Overview","701-Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0799_模块4-成长-自我超越与文明超越.md","filePath":"en/0799_模块4-成长-自我超越与文明超越.md"}`),o={name:"en/0799_模块4-成长-自我超越与文明超越.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-799-transcended-ones-and-growth-the-transcended-one-s-self-transcendence-and-civilizational-transcendence" tabindex="-1">Entry 799 | Transcended Ones and Growth | The Transcended One&#39;s Self-Transcendence and Civilizational Transcendence <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-799-transcended-ones-and-growth-the-transcended-one-s-self-transcendence-and-civilizational-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 799 | Transcended Ones and Growth | The Transcended One&#39;s Self-Transcendence and Civilizational Transcendence&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 07, 797, 701</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-transcending-oneself-is-for-transcending-civilization" tabindex="-1">Introduction: transcending oneself is for transcending civilization <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-transcending-oneself-is-for-transcending-civilization" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: transcending oneself is for transcending civilization&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s &quot;transcendence&quot; is &quot;transcending others&quot; — transcending enemies, peers, ceilings. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;transcendence&quot; has two layers: <strong>self-transcendence</strong> and <strong>civilizational transcendence</strong>. The former is the transcended one continuously transcending his own limits; the latter is the transcended one converting personal transcendence into civilization&#39;s overall transcendence. This entry discusses the relationship between these two transcendences.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all line up: the anti-predation axiom requires transcendence contain no predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires civilizational transcendence benefit Myriad Ranks; the collective ascension axiom is civilizational transcendence&#39;s core; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the transcendence process not disturb causality; the law-first axiom requires the two transcendences&#39; relationship be self-consistent at the law layer.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-self-transcendence-s-three-directions" tabindex="-1">I. Self-Transcendence&#39;s Three Directions <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-self-transcendence-s-three-directions" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Self-Transcendence&#39;s Three Directions&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s self-transcendence is not &quot;combat-power number growing,&quot; but three directions:</p><ol><li><strong>Cognitive transcendence</strong>: continuously transcending one&#39;s own understanding of Myriad Ranks — from &quot;only understand humankind&quot; to &quot;understand five lineages,&quot; from &quot;understand now&quot; to &quot;understand history and future&quot;;</li><li><strong>Ethical transcendence</strong>: continuously transcending one&#39;s own ethical limits — from &quot;not predating&quot; to &quot;non-interference,&quot; from &quot;non-interference&quot; to &quot;proactive feedback&quot;;</li><li><strong>Post transcendence</strong>: continuously transcending one&#39;s own post ability — from &quot;calibrate one star sector&quot; to &quot;calibrate one galaxy group,&quot; from &quot;bring 3 disciples&quot; to &quot;train a generation of transcended ones.&quot;</li></ol><p>Three directions together; self-transcendence is &quot;as a living anchor, functional upgrade.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-civilizational-transcendence-s-three-directions" tabindex="-1">II. Civilizational Transcendence&#39;s Three Directions <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-civilizational-transcendence-s-three-directions" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Civilizational Transcendence&#39;s Three Directions&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s self-transcendence ultimately must convert into civilizational transcendence. Civilizational transcendence&#39;s three directions:</p><ol><li><strong>Law-network upgrade</strong>: the law network the transcended one calibrates gets more stable and broader; the whole civilization&#39;s law infrastructure upgrades;</li><li><strong>Myriad-Rank coverage upgrade</strong>: the Myriad-Rank clans the transcended one serves get more; 99% coverage approaches 100%;</li><li><strong>Knowledge-system upgrade</strong>: knowledge the transcended one backflows gets more systematic; the 300-set system continuously iterates; later-comers&#39; starting point gets higher.</li></ol><p>Three directions together; civilizational transcendence is &quot;the whole Myriad-Rank civilization&#39;s water level rising.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-two-transcendences-relationship" tabindex="-1">III. The Two Transcendences&#39; Relationship <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-two-transcendences-relationship" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Two Transcendences&#39; Relationship&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-transcendence and civilizational transcendence are not two things, but two sides of one thing:</p><ul><li><strong>Civilizational transcendence without self-transcendence is empty talk</strong>: you yourself don&#39;t grow, what do you use to lead civilization to grow?</li><li><strong>Self-transcendence without civilizational transcendence is waste</strong>: you yourself grow, but don&#39;t convert into civilizational increment, equal to growing in vain.</li></ul><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s formula: <strong>self-transcendence × civilizational conversion = true transcended growth.</strong> No matter how large self-transcendence is, civilizational conversion zero, product zero. This is the same logic as entry 706&#39;s civilizational-weight formula (destructive power × civilizational consensus degree). The conversion process of the two transcendences is recorded throughout by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, non-fabricable, non-interruptible.</p><h2 id="iv-why-old-world-protagonists-have-no-civilizational-transcendence" tabindex="-1">IV. Why Old-World Protagonists Have No Civilizational Transcendence <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-why-old-world-protagonists-have-no-civilizational-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Why Old-World Protagonists Have No Civilizational Transcendence&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Old-world protagonists have self-transcendence (combat power growing stronger), but civilizational transcendence is almost zero:</p><ul><li><strong>Tang Luo</strong>: he grew stronger, but civilization did not grow stronger — Myriad Ranks are still locked in the fierce realm;</li><li><strong>Ye Fan</strong>: he grew stronger, but civilization did not grow stronger — Myriad Ranks are still the protected;</li><li><strong>Shi Hao</strong>: he grew stronger, but civilization did not grow stronger — Myriad Ranks are still autocratically decided;</li><li><strong>Goku</strong>: he grew stronger, but civilization did not grow stronger — Earth is still that Earth.</li></ul><p>Their self-transcendence did not convert into civilizational transcendence. Heng Yuan Zhou requires every bit of the transcended one&#39;s self-transcendence have a corresponding civilizational-conversion indicator.</p><p>Between the two transcendences there is a positive-feedback loop. New problems the transcended one encounters in civilizational transcendence — such as law conflicts of a newly accessed cosmos, special difficulties of a weak race — will in turn expose his own cognitive blind spots, pushing him to self-transcend; and new abilities and new perspectives he gains after self-transcendence can help him solve civilizational-engineering problems he could not solve before. Old-world protagonists only walk the &quot;self-transcendence&quot; line, growing stronger yet lonelier, because their growth has no external object to feedback; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s transcended ones must tie the two lines together, self-transcendence&#39;s depth is tested by civilizational-transcendence results, civilizational-transcendence&#39;s height is limited by self-transcendence&#39;s ceiling. Either leg short, the other cannot walk far.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: self-transcendence not converting into civilizational transcendence is computable-power waste; Heng Yuan Zhou uses conversion indicators to tie the two transcendences together</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: transcendence relies on the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle, not predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo only has self-transcendence (combat power growing stronger), no civilizational transcendence; Heng Yuan Zhou requires both transcendences happen simultaneously</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: civilizational transcendence directly benefits all Myriad-Rank clans</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: transcendence&#39;s entire indicators, teaching material, and engineering records are opened network-wide through the Selfless Dao. The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm transcended one&#39;s two transcendences (self × civilizational) are perpetual growth&#39;s ultimate ruler</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transcending oneself is for transcending civilization. Self-transcendence is the means; civilizational transcendence is the end. The two transcendences tied together is true perpetual growth. Old-world protagonists only did the first half; Heng Yuan Zhou requires the transcended one do the second half too — and the second half is true transcendence.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/07-自生自长进化法则.html">Entry 07 · Self-Generated-Self-Grown Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/797_模块4-成长-总论.html">Entry 797 · Transcended Ones and Growth Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/701-超脱正统定义总论.html">Entry 701 · Transcendence-Orthodox Definition Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/706-超脱者的文明权重.html">Entry 706 · Transcended One&#39;s Civilizational Weight</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const f=n(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,f as default};
